# USC SideQuest — environment
#
# Everything in the app works with no key at all: research falls back to the
# pre-generated cached plans in lib/research/fixtures, and the UI says so plainly.
# Set a key to run the live, web-searched research path.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Copy this file to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill it in.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Force the cached research path even when a key is present — useful
# for demoing the offline experience. Anything other than "cached" is ignored.
# RESEARCH_MODE=cached
